"correct positioning."
msgstr ""
"**Location Kml** - 点击此按钮时，地理标记工具将打开 Google Earth 并在地图上显示图片位置，供用户检查定位是否正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-images-with-mission-planner.rst:290
#: e6c1af7d5fe84d82bbef7ca1a4604b00
msgid ""
"**GeoTag Images** - If everything was correct in previous steps and pictures"
